1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,105
Attention, everyone!

2
00:00:01,380 --> 00:00:09,500
The parking lot on the west side of our building will be closed starting from this Friday, January 25, until March 15, due to construction.

3
00:00:10,155 --> 00:00:16,200
Therefore, those employees who enter the building from Midland Avenue must use the south entrance from Jane Street.

4
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:25,080
Also, we ask everyone to please park your cars in our underground garage to allow our customers access to the parking spots on the ground floor.

5
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:31,420
I know this will cause some inconvenience to our salespeople, who come in and out of our building throughout the day.

6
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:37,410
However, we do ask you to bear with this situation until the construction comes to its completion.

7
00:00:37,935 --> 00:00:45,800
Also, we'd like to make a suggestion for those employees who live near the office to leave their cars at home and take public transportation to work.

8
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,700
One other option is to start carpooling.

9
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:55,880
Anyway, think about it, and if you have any great ideas, please go and speak with our receptionist Janice anytime.
